# Copy to config/private-words.txt (git-ignored) and list, one per line, words that must never
# appear in tracked files: internal codenames, private hostnames, personal paths, anything you
# don't want in a public repository. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
# PrivateWordsTests checks every tracked text file against it, and skips when the file is absent.
example-internal-codename
example-private-hostname
